{"page":439,"verses":[{"verse_key":"35:39","surah":35,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَكُمْ خَلَـٰٓئِفَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ فَمَن كَفَرَ فَعَلَيْهِ كُفْرُهُۥ ۖ وَلَا يَزِيدُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ كُفْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ إِلَّا مَقْتًا ۖ وَلَا يَزِيدُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ كُفْرُهُمْ إِلَّا خَسَارًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"it is He who made you [people] successors to the land. Those who deny the truth will bear the consequences: their denial will only make them more odious to their Lord, and add only to their loss.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَعَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"made you","transliteration":"jaʿalakum","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَـٰٓئِفَ","en_gloss":"successors","transliteration":"khalāifa","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"disbelieves","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَعَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"then upon him","transliteration":"faʿalayhi","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُفْرُهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) his disbelief","transliteration":"kuf'ruhu","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَزِيدُ","en_gloss":"increase","transliteration":"yazīdu","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كُفْرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their disbelief","transliteration":"kuf'ruhum","verse_key":"35:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"35:39"},{